# Vibe Code Protocol & Execution

## Mục tiêu

Execute vibe code với:
1. **Pre-review Gates** - validation trước khi implement
2. **Post-review Gates** - quality check sau khi implement
3. **Auth/Payment Handling** - special handling cho security-sensitive tasks
4. **Retry Logic** - fallback strategies khi execution fails

